WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.835
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:05.672
With some first year student additions,
M's begins to practice as a true club.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.257
But when we went to get our club approved...

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:11.511
Since Idol Study Club already exists,
I cannot accept this club application.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:14.639
That's when we found the third year,
Yazawa Nico-senpai, waiting for us.

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:17.767
I recall telling you that you're
all defiling the image of idols.

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:23.189
When we learned that she'd wanted to be a
school idol for years, we had her join J's.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.733
It won't be easy.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.610
That's how p's came to
have seven members.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:30.071
Jeez... I never planned to sign up for this...

00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:32.824
Uh...

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:33.950
Come on, smile.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.952
Huh?

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:37.287
Strike a pose.

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:38.580
What?

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.248
Okay, um...

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:48.048
This is Kosaka Honoka, the leader of p's—
Otonokizaka High's school idol group.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:48.840
Yes, her.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.425
Sweet.

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.302
Um, what's going on...?

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:55.096
Next up is...Umi-senpai!

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:58.266
Huh? Wh-What do you want from me?

00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:01.811
Wait! It's rude to film people
who are unawares!

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:03.772
- Sorry, sorry.
- Modesty is hot!

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:08.902
The student council wishes to make a video
that introduces all the school's clubs.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.529
- That's why we're interviewing you all.
- Great angle. Yeah, nice...

00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:12.572
Interviews, huh?

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.491
Doesn't that sound awesome?

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:19.663
With school idol popularity on the rise,
I felt this would be beneficial for y's.

00:01:19.663 --> 00:01:24.417
I-I'm against it. I'd rather not be filmed at all.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.669
Interviews...

00:01:26.711 --> 00:01:29.381
Such things go hand-in-hand with stardom.

00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:30.548
Honoka...?

00:01:30.548 --> 00:01:32.759
You're cool with it, right, Umi-chan?

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.553
Anyone who watches this will remember p's!

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:39.474
Yep. It'd be silly of us to refuse.

00:01:39.474 --> 00:01:40.475
Kotori!

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:44.312
We're even allowed to borrow the camera,
as long as we agree to the interviews.

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:46.606
That way, you can think of filming a PV.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.149
PV...?

00:01:48.149 --> 00:01:52.987
The only promotional video from u's
as of now stars just you three.

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:53.571
Oh.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:57.575
And we don't even know who
took that video of us...

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:02.455
Umi-chan, haven't you been saying
we should work on a new song?

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.165
That settles it!

00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:07.711
Oh, come on!

00:02:07.711 --> 00:02:11.256
Okay, I'll go spread the good news!

00:02:11.256 --> 00:02:12.966
- Wait for me!
- Stop, Honoka!

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:30.775
<i>Massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will fie us all together.</i>

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:35.613
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:02:35.613 --> 00:02:40.410
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:44.998
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:46.082
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:46.082 --> 00:02:49.961
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:02:49.961 --> 00:02:50.962
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:50.962 --> 00:02:54.799
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:02:54.799 --> 00:02:55.842
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:59.929
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:02:59.929 --> 00:03:04.601
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:09.606
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:03:09.606 --> 00:03:14.277
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:03:14.277 --> 00:03:19.407
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:03:19.407 --> 00:03:24.370
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:29.876
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:37.467
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:03:38.843 --> 00:03:42.222
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:03:45.767 --> 00:03:48.686
She's called a school idol,
meaning she's still a student.

00:03:48.686 --> 00:03:54.192
Unlike career idols, she's not allowed to take
evening classes or leave school early.

00:03:54.192 --> 00:03:57.695
As a result, capturing this
phenomenon is not uncommon.

00:03:57.695 --> 00:03:59.864
After eating a carb-heavy lunch...

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:01.991
she continues her nap.

00:04:03.993 --> 00:04:07.872
She is eventually caught by her teacher.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.919
Yes, she may be a school idol,
but Honoka is still a 16-year-old girl.

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:15.672
#6 - Who is the Center? This has been
an honest account of Kosaka Honoka—

00:04:15.672 --> 00:04:17.465
It's way foo honest!

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:19.634
When'd you film all that, anyway?

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:22.136
You've got a knack for this, Kotori-senpai.

00:04:22.136 --> 00:04:25.807
Thank you. Getting this footage in
secret really got my heart pumping.

00:04:25.807 --> 00:04:27.892
What? You did this, Kotori-chan!?

00:04:27.892 --> 00:04:28.893
You traitor!

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:32.230
This is your comeuppance for
acting lazy all the time.

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.815
- From now on, you should...
- Amazing, Umi-chan!

00:04:37.318 --> 00:04:39.779
She's so serious when she practices archery.

00:04:40.989 --> 00:04:42.282
Is she...?

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:45.201
Is she practicing how to make
a super cute smile?

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.162
Invasion of privacy!

00:04:48.162 --> 00:04:51.666
Fine then, two can play at this game...

00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:55.044
We're gonna have to invade
Kotori-chan's privacy, too.

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:57.130
Oh, what's this?

00:05:00.049 --> 00:05:01.467
Kotori-chan, what's wrong?

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:02.552
Nothing.

00:05:02.552 --> 00:05:04.679
- But...
- Nothing means nothing!

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:08.558
Once this phase is complete, we'll have
all the clubs check their footage...

00:05:08.558 --> 00:05:10.268
and make any desired edits.

00:05:10.268 --> 00:05:13.104
But if the student council president
happens to see our video first...

00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:14.981
Absolutely unacceptable.

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:18.902
Thanks solely to you, everyone now views
Otonokizaka High as a school for the lazy.

00:05:20.194 --> 00:05:22.697
Then maybe you should work
on how you present yourself.

00:05:22.697 --> 00:05:26.200
What? Nozomi-senpai, you mean
you won't back us up, then?

00:05:26.451 --> 00:05:32.582
I wish that I could, but unfortunately,
my role is limited to that of moral support.

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:34.125
Moral support?

00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:38.087
In other words, don't worry
about me. Next up is...

00:05:39.964 --> 00:05:42.342
Oh, Nico-senpai.

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:44.218
Are we really being interviewed?

00:05:44.636 --> 00:05:46.888
Oh, she's already here. Lookit!

00:05:51.476 --> 00:05:53.937
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:05:53.937 --> 00:05:57.649
I'm Yazawa Nico, here to brighten
your Nico-Nico day!

00:05:57.649 --> 00:06:01.069
Let's see, um, my favorite food is—

00:06:01.069 --> 00:06:03.321
Sorry, not interested.

00:06:03.321 --> 00:06:04.197
Huh?

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:07.825
They're trying to capture candid
video of club members.

00:06:08.326 --> 00:06:09.535
Candid...!

00:06:10.078 --> 00:06:13.164
Okay, okay. That's your theme, then...

00:06:13.665 --> 00:06:15.500
Just a sec.

00:06:22.006 --> 00:06:26.052
Honestly, this is my everyday appearance.

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:29.681
When I work as an idol, I become
a completely different girl.

00:06:29.681 --> 00:06:33.226
When I tie up my hair,
it's like I'm flipping a switch.

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:36.104
Hmm? Oh, right.

00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:40.233
I don't normally refer to myself as "Nico."

00:06:41.025 --> 00:06:42.568
Where the hell'd they go!?

00:06:43.027 --> 00:06:45.196
S-Someone rescue me...

00:06:45.196 --> 00:06:47.156
Stop being nervous. You'll do fine.

00:06:47.156 --> 00:06:49.701
Just answer my questions, okay?

00:06:49.701 --> 00:06:53.538
We'll be editing the video, so take
however much time you need.

00:06:53.538 --> 00:06:54.914
B-But...

00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:56.916
I'm right here with you. Let's do it.

00:06:58.793 --> 00:07:01.379
Maki-chan, come over and join us.

00:07:01.379 --> 00:07:03.172
I'm not doing this.

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:04.882
Jeez...

00:07:04.882 --> 00:07:06.217
That's quite all right.

00:07:06.217 --> 00:07:09.804
If you're staunchly against it, we won't
force you to be part of the interviews.

00:07:11.514 --> 00:07:15.101
Maki over there is the only member who
refused our inquiry for an interview.

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:19.230
When not working as a school idol, she's
your typical impressionable 15 year old.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:23.192
- This must be her natural charm, as well.
- Why are you improvising your narration?

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:28.072
First, I'd like to ask you girls what you find
most appealing about being an idol.

00:07:28.072 --> 00:07:29.907
Hanayo-san, let's hear your thoughts first.

00:07:29.907 --> 00:07:33.077
What? Um, I...

00:07:33.077 --> 00:07:36.122
Kayo-chin, you've always loved idols, right?

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:37.665
Th-That's right.

00:07:37.665 --> 00:07:39.459
Is that why you became a school idol?

00:07:39.459 --> 00:07:42.253
Yes, well...

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:46.215
Stop filming!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:51.596
Aw, c'mon! She was so nervous that I had
to try and loosen her up somehow!

00:07:51.596 --> 00:07:53.097
Kotori-senpai.

00:07:53.097 --> 00:07:54.849
Workin' hard, ladies?

00:07:54.849 --> 00:07:56.267
Unbelievable.

00:07:56.267 --> 00:07:58.686
Everyone will get the wrong
impression about J's.

00:08:00.021 --> 00:08:02.356
Maki-chan, that sounds like you're
sincerely worried about our image!

00:08:03.691 --> 00:08:05.985
N-No, I'm not...

00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:09.030
Stop filming me!

00:08:09.614 --> 00:08:10.907
Stop filming me!

00:08:10.907 --> 00:08:14.994
So, after looking at all the
footage we've taken...

00:08:14.994 --> 00:08:17.955
It appears as though you're all
lazy and enjoy goofing off.

00:08:17.955 --> 00:08:18.915
What!?

00:08:18.915 --> 00:08:22.752
But for school idols, their real work ethic
shines during practice, right?

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:24.045
That's true.

00:08:24.462 --> 00:08:27.715
Okay, let's put our all into practice today!

00:08:28.091 --> 00:08:30.218
One, two, three, four...

00:08:30.218 --> 00:08:32.178
Five, six, seven, eight...

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:33.721
Hanayo, you're a half-beat behind.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:34.764
O-Okay.

00:08:35.056 --> 00:08:36.599
Rin, you're a half-beat ahead.

00:08:36.599 --> 00:08:37.350
Gotcha.

00:08:37.767 --> 00:08:39.685
Dance it properly!

00:08:39.977 --> 00:08:43.689
Nico-senpai, you're still making the same
mistakes I pointed out yesterday.

00:08:44.524 --> 00:08:45.817
I'm well aware...

00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:47.985
Maki, show more explosive movements.

00:08:47.985 --> 00:08:48.611
Got it.

00:08:48.986 --> 00:08:50.738
Honoka, will you need a break soon?

00:08:50.738 --> 00:08:51.614
No way!

00:08:52.073 --> 00:08:54.408
Kotori, don't forget that one move.

00:08:54.408 --> 00:08:54.867
"Kay.

00:08:55.159 --> 00:08:56.244
The finale!

00:09:01.165 --> 00:09:02.416
After a full hour of dancing...

00:09:02.416 --> 00:09:04.502
Kotori-chan, pass me some water, stat...

00:09:04.502 --> 00:09:07.713
They're finally taking a break.

00:09:09.382 --> 00:09:13.302
Everyone's out of breath, but nobody
is voicing any complaints.

00:09:13.845 --> 00:09:14.595
So?

00:09:15.012 --> 00:09:17.849
As I thought, your intensity is
different when practicing.

00:09:17.849 --> 00:09:20.268
You work hard when you need to.

00:09:20.852 --> 00:09:21.602
I guess.

00:09:21.894 --> 00:09:26.107
But shouldn't practice be
conducted by the group leader?

00:09:26.107 --> 00:09:27.150
Well...

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:31.195
After our break, let's all go over our
group choreography, move by move.

00:09:31.195 --> 00:09:33.573
Make sure you're doing your image training.

00:09:33.573 --> 00:09:34.907
Okay!

00:09:37.368 --> 00:09:39.537
You should've said something sooner!

00:09:39.537 --> 00:09:41.706
- Hold on!
- She's part of the student council.

00:09:41.706 --> 00:09:46.169
She just has a few questions for you.
There's no reason to overdo it...

00:09:46.169 --> 00:09:48.171
How couldn't I1?

00:09:48.171 --> 00:09:51.174
Not like you look any different
with makeup on anywa—

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.636
I'll introduce my little sister first.

00:09:55.636 --> 00:09:57.471
Yukiho, you in there?

00:09:57.471 --> 00:09:59.182
A little more...

00:09:59.182 --> 00:10:02.143
Just one more...!

00:10:02.143 --> 00:10:05.521
I'm sorry. They're both pretty weird...

00:10:05.521 --> 00:10:06.898
And your father?

00:10:06.898 --> 00:10:08.941
Oh, I went into the kitchen before, and...

00:10:11.444 --> 00:10:12.486
So...

00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:15.948
I see. Is this where you all tend to gather?

00:10:15.948 --> 00:10:20.536
Yeah. Kotori-senpai and Umi-senpai
seem to come here all the time.

00:10:20.536 --> 00:10:21.746
They get shacks!

00:10:23.414 --> 00:10:24.874
Only Japanese sweets, though.

00:10:25.249 --> 00:10:26.709
I see.

00:10:29.629 --> 00:10:32.381
Lyrics Notebook
Is this where your lyrics are composed?

00:10:32.381 --> 00:10:34.008
Yeah, Umi-chan handles that.

00:10:34.008 --> 00:10:34.800
Oh?

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.970
Umi-senpai comes up with most of our lyrics.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:40.890
And who puts your choreography together?

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.600
Kotori-chan handles that.

00:10:43.559 --> 00:10:45.978
Then...what do you do?

00:10:48.481 --> 00:10:56.113
I eat, watch TV, stare at other idols,
and think about how amazing they are.

00:10:56.614 --> 00:10:59.492
Plus, I give the other two moral support!

00:11:01.202 --> 00:11:02.620
That's all?

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:03.329
Huh?

00:11:03.788 --> 00:11:10.127
This has been on my mind for a while...
Honoka-chan, why're you the leader of p's?

00:11:14.298 --> 00:11:15.424
Love Live!

00:11:17.093 --> 00:11:19.387
Who's fit to lead, huh?

00:11:19.387 --> 00:11:24.475
Being the club founder, I should've had
us really think it over after the merge.

00:11:24.475 --> 00:11:25.893
Our leader, huh?

00:11:25.893 --> 00:11:28.354
I don't mind if Honoka-chan keeps doing it.

00:11:28.354 --> 00:11:29.397
Not good enough.

00:11:29.397 --> 00:11:31.774
That interview made it painfully clear.

00:11:31.774 --> 00:11:34.485
This girl's not leader material.

00:11:34.485 --> 00:11:35.945
Yeah, true enough.

00:11:35.945 --> 00:11:37.071
But...

00:11:37.071 --> 00:11:41.492
In that case, we need to decide on it soon.
We need to get cracking on our PV.

00:11:41.993 --> 00:11:42.910
The PV?

00:11:43.619 --> 00:11:47.748
Understand that if we change our leader,
we also change who stands in the center.

00:11:47.748 --> 00:11:50.293
In our PV, that spot is reserved for the leader.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:51.711
Makes sense.

00:11:51.961 --> 00:11:52.962
But who?

00:11:54.630 --> 00:12:01.470
A leader must be the most passionate of
all and keep everyone moving forward!

00:12:01.762 --> 00:12:06.767
She must also possess enough generosity
to become a mental pillar for the others!

00:12:07.143 --> 00:12:10.938
Finally, she must be well respected
by the entire group!

00:12:11.355 --> 00:12:14.567
In other words, the sole member
who has all these qualities is...

00:12:15.484 --> 00:12:16.569
Umi-senpai, maybe?

00:12:16.861 --> 00:12:18.029
Why her!?

00:12:18.529 --> 00:12:19.655
Me?

00:12:19.655 --> 00:12:23.117
Yeah, Umi-chan! You'd probably
make a really cool leader.

00:12:24.243 --> 00:12:25.745
Are you fine with this?

00:12:26.245 --> 00:12:27.997
Huh? Why wouldn't I be?

00:12:27.997 --> 00:12:30.666
She's trying to wrest away
your position as leader.

00:12:31.042 --> 00:12:32.460
Huh? So?

00:12:33.419 --> 00:12:35.504
Don't you feel anything?

00:12:35.504 --> 00:12:38.799
Well, I mean, we'll still all be
members of u's, right?

00:12:38.799 --> 00:12:41.427
But you won't be in the center anymore!

00:12:41.886 --> 00:12:43.888
Oh, right!

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:47.933
Meh, whatever.

00:12:47.933 --> 00:12:49.185
What!?

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.562
Are you absolutely certain about this?

00:12:51.562 --> 00:12:54.440
So Umi-chan will be our new leader!

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.484
H-Hold on...

00:12:58.069 --> 00:12:59.111
I can't...

00:12:59.445 --> 00:13:01.197
You're always such a chore.

00:13:01.197 --> 00:13:02.615
Why not you, Kotori-senpai?

00:13:04.033 --> 00:13:05.284
Me?

00:13:05.284 --> 00:13:07.495
She seems more like a "secondary leader."

00:13:08.079 --> 00:13:11.916
We can't have a first year
be our leader, either...

00:13:12.249 --> 00:13:13.709
If I must, I guess I'll...

00:13:13.709 --> 00:13:16.962
I still feel like Honoka-chan is the best choice.

00:13:16.962 --> 00:13:18.589
If I must, I guess I'll...

00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:22.051
I think we need to convince
Umi-senpai to take charge.

00:13:22.051 --> 00:13:24.136
If I must, I'll...!

00:13:24.136 --> 00:13:26.430
Maybe a vote would be best?

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:29.558
IF I MUST, I'LL...!

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.396
What should we do?

00:13:33.396 --> 00:13:34.814
Yeah, I wonder...

00:13:37.983 --> 00:13:39.819
It's come to this, has it?

00:13:39.819 --> 00:13:42.822
We'll settle it through song and dance!

00:13:42.822 --> 00:13:43.948
Settle it?

00:13:43.948 --> 00:13:46.659
You want us to compete and see
who scores the highest?

00:13:46.659 --> 00:13:47.410
Bingo!

00:13:47.868 --> 00:13:51.038
The greatest singer and dancer
will be the center, naturally.

00:13:51.038 --> 00:13:51.831
Well?

00:13:51.831 --> 00:13:53.082
No detractors, I take it?

00:13:53.707 --> 00:13:55.960
But my skill at karaoke is rather lacking...

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:57.920
I don't feel like singing today.

00:13:58.087 --> 00:14:00.506
Then don't sing.

00:14:00.506 --> 00:14:03.426
You'll just be forfeiting your shot
at becoming the leader.

00:14:05.845 --> 00:14:11.517
I planned for this, so I've already picked
out a song that's easy to score high on.

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:14.145
Little do they know, the role
of leader is already mine.

00:14:14.645 --> 00:14:16.355
Okay, let's rock!

00:14:16.897 --> 00:14:18.607
Wow, karaoke feels so nostalgic.

00:14:18.607 --> 00:14:21.360
C'mon, this is serious business!

00:14:24.155 --> 00:14:25.030
How embarrassing.

00:14:25.322 --> 00:14:27.658
Please Wait
Calculating Score

00:14:29.535 --> 00:14:32.037
Umi-chan got a 93.

00:14:32.037 --> 00:14:34.165
Everyone's scored above 90 points.

00:14:34.582 --> 00:14:37.042
I bet it's thanks to our daily practice routine.

00:14:37.042 --> 00:14:41.589
M-Maki-chan always helps me
with the parts I sing too quietly.

00:14:41.589 --> 00:14:45.009
I never noticed, but we've
all improved a lot, huh?

00:14:45.468 --> 00:14:47.636
Monstrous little sirens...

00:14:48.262 --> 00:14:49.763
We're dancing next!

00:14:49.763 --> 00:14:51.974
This won't be a cakewalk
like the song portion.

00:14:52.766 --> 00:14:54.560
We're using this bad boy right here!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.437
Apocalypse Mode Extra!

00:14:57.021 --> 00:14:59.023
Kotori-chan, a little more to the right.

00:15:00.107 --> 00:15:03.152
- You got it!
- C'mon! I said this is serious business!

00:15:03.819 --> 00:15:07.239
I admit, I'm pretty athletic, but I don't
think dancing is my strong suit.

00:15:07.948 --> 00:15:09.700
How do you play it...?

00:15:09.992 --> 00:15:14.914
Beginners with no experience can't
possibly score competitively.

00:15:15.706 --> 00:15:17.750
Karaoke got me nervous, but this—

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.084
Amazing!

00:15:20.085 --> 00:15:22.087
I managed to clear it!

00:15:22.713 --> 00:15:23.380
What?

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.174
Karaoke Contest - Dance
Results Wasn't that fun?

00:15:25.508 --> 00:15:28.219
But we all scored so close to one another.

00:15:29.261 --> 00:15:30.679
In that case, I'll...

00:15:31.305 --> 00:15:36.060
Since we couldn't decide based on that
contest, we'll choose based on our auras.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:36.936
Auras?

00:15:36.936 --> 00:15:41.232
Right. It's no exaggeration to say that
nothing matters more, as an idol.

00:15:41.732 --> 00:15:46.695
Some idols lack the raw talent, but they're
still able to draw in fans somehow.

00:15:47.238 --> 00:15:49.114
This is due solely to their auras!

00:15:49.365 --> 00:15:52.326
They have that "something”
that attracts people!

00:15:52.326 --> 00:15:54.161
L...I know what you mean!

00:15:54.161 --> 00:15:55.579
I can't take my eyes off them!

00:15:55.955 --> 00:15:58.499
How do we turn such a concept
into a valid competition?

00:15:59.792 --> 00:16:00.876
Like this.

00:16:01.335 --> 00:16:04.338
If you have the right aura, people will flock
to you even if you don't say a word.

00:16:04.755 --> 00:16:10.094
Whoever hands out the most fliers in a
single hour has the strongest aura.

00:16:10.261 --> 00:16:13.138
This contest feels a little silly...

00:16:13.138 --> 00:16:15.015
Silly, but fun! Let's do our best!

00:16:15.683 --> 00:16:17.309
This time...

00:16:17.309 --> 00:16:20.479
None have ever defeated me when
it comes to flier distribution...

00:16:20.479 --> 00:16:22.356
With my unmatched Nico smile, I...

00:16:22.523 --> 00:16:24.149
Thank you.

00:16:24.149 --> 00:16:26.318
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:28.612
Take one of these, Nico!

00:16:34.535 --> 00:16:35.452
Nico!

00:16:35.995 --> 00:16:37.746
Thank you very much.

00:16:39.123 --> 00:16:42.376
Kotori-chan, you're amazing!
Did you seriously pass them all out?

00:16:42.835 --> 00:16:46.463
Y-Yep. They were gone before I knew it.

00:16:46.797 --> 00:16:49.425
This doesn't make sense!
Have times changed so fast?

00:16:51.427 --> 00:16:53.262
In the end, it's a pretty universal draw.

00:16:53.262 --> 00:16:54.597
Indeed.

00:16:55.097 --> 00:16:58.559
Hanayo had a low dancing score,
but got high marks for her singing.

00:16:58.559 --> 00:17:02.896
Kotori had a low karaoke score,
but passed out fliers like none other.

00:17:03.355 --> 00:17:06.025
I guess that means we're all leaders!

00:17:06.442 --> 00:17:08.527
You're impressive, Nico-senpai.

00:17:08.527 --> 00:17:12.114
You haven't practiced nearly as long as us,
but your scores were right up there, too.

00:17:13.657 --> 00:17:14.825
Well, naturally.

00:17:15.242 --> 00:17:18.579
Where do we go from here? We can't
make a decision based on this data.

00:17:18.912 --> 00:17:20.372
Y-You're right.

00:17:20.372 --> 00:17:23.834
B-But I still think an upperclassman
should be our leader.

00:17:24.209 --> 00:17:26.629
- Well then, if I must, I'll...
- I agree.

00:17:26.629 --> 00:17:28.631
I didn't want the role to begin with.

00:17:29.089 --> 00:17:30.841
You're a stubborn lot, aren't you?

00:17:31.133 --> 00:17:33.844
Maybe we don't need a dedicated leader.

00:17:35.137 --> 00:17:36.305
No leader?

00:17:36.305 --> 00:17:40.392
Right. I bet we can handle
things just fine without one.

00:17:40.392 --> 00:17:43.479
We've been practicing and singing
without one all this time.

00:17:44.438 --> 00:17:45.189
But...

00:17:45.356 --> 00:17:48.984
"But," indeed! There's no such
thing as a leaderless group!

00:17:49.151 --> 00:17:51.278
What'll we do about the center, then?

00:17:51.612 --> 00:17:53.155
About that...

00:17:53.155 --> 00:17:56.992
I've been thinking...
Why don't we all just rotate?

00:17:58.243 --> 00:17:59.036
All of us?

00:17:59.453 --> 00:18:02.998
It dawned on me while watching
idol videos at home.

00:18:03.415 --> 00:18:08.921
I thought, "Wouldn't it be cool if
we took turns being the center?”

00:18:09.797 --> 00:18:12.966
Then I thought, if we could write
a song that lets us do that...

00:18:13.592 --> 00:18:14.968
We...take turns?

00:18:14.968 --> 00:18:15.886
Yeah.

00:18:15.886 --> 00:18:16.845
Think it's doable?

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:20.432
At the very least, it isn't impossible.

00:18:21.016 --> 00:18:23.185
Songs like that do exist already.

00:18:23.185 --> 00:18:25.854
How about the choreography, then?

00:18:25.854 --> 00:18:29.358
I can think of something that
uses all seven of us.

00:18:29.358 --> 00:18:31.694
Then that sounds perfect to me!

00:18:31.694 --> 00:18:34.363
Now everyone gets a solo, and
everyone gets to be the center!

00:18:34.988 --> 00:18:36.365
Agreed!

00:18:36.365 --> 00:18:37.741
Do whatever you want.

00:18:37.908 --> 00:18:40.035
I get my own solo...!

00:18:40.035 --> 00:18:41.578
D-Do I get one, too...?

00:18:41.578 --> 00:18:44.164
This may prove a tad difficult.

00:18:46.333 --> 00:18:48.168
It can't be helped, then.

00:18:48.168 --> 00:18:51.004
Make sure my part's really cool.

00:18:51.422 --> 00:18:52.965
Okey-dokey.

00:18:55.342 --> 00:18:59.388
All right! With that settled, let's start practice!

00:19:01.807 --> 00:19:06.145
But is it really okay not to have a leader?

00:19:06.145 --> 00:19:08.355
Believe it or not, we did
elect our group leader.

00:19:09.064 --> 00:19:10.399
Reluctantly.

00:19:11.233 --> 00:19:14.695
Without getting caught up in anything
else, in unflinching pursuit of her dreams...

00:19:14.695 --> 00:19:18.449
Doing what she wants to do the most,
what interests her like nothing else...

00:19:19.199 --> 00:19:22.286
Only Honoka has these stand-out traits.

00:19:25.164 --> 00:19:26.957
C'mon, let's get started!

00:19:38.677 --> 00:19:43.974
If we can all gather our
different feelings together,

00:19:43.974 --> 00:19:46.643
everything just might work out.

00:19:46.643 --> 00:19:49.938
It'd be a lie to say that we're strong,

00:19:49.938 --> 00:19:52.983
but we strongly want all our dreams to grow!

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:57.988
It'd be a lie to say we know it all.

00:19:57.988 --> 00:20:02.701
It's not like we have a guide
on life in our pockets.

00:20:02.701 --> 00:20:05.746
We're okay with just one step at a time,

00:20:05.746 --> 00:20:08.874
so we'll move forward with
our heads held high.

00:20:10.459 --> 00:20:12.461
But what should we do if we stumble?

00:20:14.421 --> 00:20:18.467
Maybe we should smile and laugh it off?
(Tee-hee-hee!)

00:20:18.467 --> 00:20:26.433
It'll be fine if we don't do that!
Let's act like we normally would!

00:20:26.433 --> 00:20:27.476
One, two, three, four!

00:20:27.476 --> 00:20:28.936
And here we all are!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:37.528
SOMEDAY, someday soon, we'll make
even our wildest dreams come true!

00:20:37.528 --> 00:20:45.327
SOMEDAY, someday soon, we believe
that we can make it happen!

00:20:45.327 --> 00:20:50.624
We don't have a moment to spare
for shedding any tears!

00:20:50.624 --> 00:20:56.088
It's just beginning—there's more and more
and more and more fun to be had!

00:21:08.851 --> 00:21:11.228
Someday's Future

00:21:11.395 --> 00:21:12.688
What did you tell them?

00:21:13.021 --> 00:21:17.943
Merely my personal feelings,
unlike a certain someone I know.

00:21:19.653 --> 00:21:22.239
Isn't it time to be true to yourself?

00:21:22.239 --> 00:21:25.701
If you help them as well, those girls
could become even more—

00:21:25.701 --> 00:21:28.245
Then why don't you just go join them?

00:21:29.288 --> 00:21:30.372
This isn't about me.

00:21:31.331 --> 00:21:32.958
The cards keep telling me...

00:21:32.958 --> 00:21:36.169
The one those girls need...is you.

00:21:37.462 --> 00:21:38.505
I can't.

00:21:40.799 --> 00:21:42.551
Really?

00:21:44.094 --> 00:21:45.262
E-Excuse me!

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:51.101
Hanayo?

00:21:51.101 --> 00:21:52.811
M-Maki-chan.

00:21:52.811 --> 00:21:54.563
It's an emergency!

00:21:55.022 --> 00:21:56.481
Come to the club room!

00:21:56.481 --> 00:21:57.274
Huh?

00:22:02.154 --> 00:22:03.572
What's going on, Hanayo-chan?

00:22:06.116 --> 00:22:08.493
S-Someone rescue me!

00:22:08.493 --> 00:22:09.870
Rescue you...?

00:22:09.870 --> 00:22:11.872
I mean, it's an emergency!

00:22:12.414 --> 00:22:14.041
An emergency!

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:20.797
Sunao ni oikakete yuukide oikakete Chase after
it with honesty, chase after it with courage.

00:22:20.797 --> 00:22:26.261
Chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru That one
small wish is what will help to create tomorrow.

00:22:26.595 --> 00:22:32.684
Dekirukamo minna ga nozomunara It might
be possible if we all want it to come true.

00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:39.650
Dare yori ganbacchae tonikaku Jjounetsu no mama ni Give it
more effort than anyone else and stay as passionate as ever.

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:44.696
Mezasu no wa kireina kaze fuku michi Let's aim to
find our path while riding on a beautiful wind.

00:22:45.614 --> 00:22:51.161
Hane no youni ude agete Spread your
arms out wide like they're your own wings.

00:22:51.161 --> 00:22:56.416
Mabushii mirai e to tobuyo We'll use
them to take off into our bright future.

00:22:57.626 --> 00:23:04.007
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ni kikoeru You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, you can hear it in this one moment.

00:23:04.007 --> 00:23:09.596
Egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu As long as
we see you smiling, every day is worth it!

00:23:09.596 --> 00:23:15.936
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ga mitaine You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, we want to see you at that moment.

00:23:15.936 --> 00:23:21.858
Tonari ni kimi ga ite (ureshii keshiki) I want you
to be right beside me. (It's such happy scenery.)

00:23:21.858 --> 00:23:27.239
Tonari wa kimi nanda
Only when the one right there is you.

00:23:35.831 --> 00:23:38.917
Next time on Love Live!
"Elichika"
